        dispersion is the finding. Consumer silicon with no datacenter bundle rents near
        <strong>$1 per kW-hr</strong>. Air-cooled datacenter silicon is flat at
        <strong>$4.50–4.66</strong> across five years of age (A100 = H100 = L40S per watt). Liquid-class
