          and the colo asking band are shown separately. All cost rungs per chip-TDP-kW via the
          1.8× system factor. Component sources: CBRE (the commercial-real-estate services firm) for the
          wholesale colo asking band; the U.S. Energy Information Administration (EIA) for the power
